Methodology
  - The consulting methodology generalises the author's earlier internal work (client-ai-agents).
  - Native diagram research was informed by Cathryn Lavery's Diagram Design (MIT,
    https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design, inspected commit 0b9b10cab3dbf695642fa1a6c4b4f60df9083689).
    SlideCraft's TypeScript diagram implementation is original; no upstream code, fonts or assets are bundled.

Not included
  - @oai/artifact-tool (OpenAI, proprietary, internal evaluation and testing only) is never
    copied, vendored or bundled. The optional adapter in src/backends/artifact-tool.ts only calls
    a copy the user already has installed with Codex.
